21
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:37,230
My Thunder Celestial Grand Formation

22
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:39,030
shall be

23
00:03:39,480 --> 00:03:40,640
completed today !

24
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:46,520
The formation isn't complete,

25
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:48,270
but space is already on the verge of collapse.

26
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:50,280
If this formation is completed,

27
00:03:50,320 --> 00:03:52,430
the Thunder Celestial Realm will become a dead area.

28
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:12,400
I can't escape.

29
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:14,870
For now, I'll just have to improvise.

30
00:04:16,400 --> 00:04:17,630
The origin energy of this man

31
00:04:17,760 --> 00:04:19,310
is shaking half of the Celestial Realm fragments.

32
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:23,470
What's his cultivation level ?

33
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:27,510
Refining the Celestial Realm into an artifact ?

34
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,110
Not a bad idea.

35
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:32,910
But without a formation spirit to anchor it,

36
00:04:33,520 --> 00:04:36,430
it's nothing but a pile of slightly large rocks.

37
00:04:38,640 --> 00:04:39,910
Celestial Lord,

38
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:41,630
have a look at that !

39
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:45,310
Formation spirits...

40
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:46,640
Appear !

41
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:00,400
They're all Origin Souls of Illusory Yin cultivators !?

42
00:05:06,880 --> 00:05:08,550
28 souls,

43
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:09,830
merge !

44
00:05:12,960 --> 00:05:14,590
A mere rank 4 Upper Celestial ?

45
00:05:15,280 --> 00:05:16,550
How embarrassing...

46
00:05:18,880 --> 00:05:20,550
Celestial Lord, wait a moment.

47
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:23,030
Formation spirits, appear again !

48
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:36,670
Given his strength,

49
00:05:36,760 --> 00:05:39,040
killing over a dozen Corporeal Yang cultivators to take their souls

50
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:40,030
isn't difficult.

51
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:47,630
Rank 9 Upper Celestial ?

52
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:49,150
It's nothing special.

53
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:52,270
Appear again !

54
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:56,790
This aura rivals that of the Huan Family Ancestor !

55
00:05:56,880 --> 00:05:58,560
It must be a Nirvana Scryer cultivator !

56
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:17,510
Rank 3 Sky Celestial ?

57
00:06:18,280 --> 00:06:19,030
It's passable.

58
00:06:56,160 --> 00:06:57,230
This one

59
00:06:57,880 --> 00:06:59,510
is somewhat interesting.

60
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:02,270
A rank 9 Sky Celestial.

61
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:05,310
What a pity,

62
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:08,150
he was the fourth person fated with me.

63
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:11,360
This person's cultivation...

64
00:07:11,440 --> 00:07:12,630
I can't see through it.

65
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:15,040
A prodigy of this caliber

66
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:17,280
is only good enough to be used as a formation spirit ?

67
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:20,280
What are you roaring about ?

68
00:07:51,840 --> 00:07:53,710
A rank 2 Celestial King...

69
00:07:54,960 --> 00:07:56,240
Fifth soul,

70
00:07:56,840 --> 00:07:57,590
get into position !

71
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:01,830
Remember your promise.

72
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:34,390
Blood Ancestor !

73
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:45,510
Fourth soul,

74
00:08:46,640 --> 00:08:47,670
get into position !

75
00:08:54,800 --> 00:08:56,670
Using a rank 6 Celestial King as a formation spirit

76
00:08:57,160 --> 00:08:58,470
is quite a feat.

77
00:08:59,040 --> 00:09:00,070
Do you have

78
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:02,750
a Celestial Lord ?

79
00:09:04,480 --> 00:09:05,990
Of course.

80
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:25,670
This pressure...

81
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:27,830
I've only felt it from the All-Seer !

82
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:30,830
Such extraordinary experts

83
00:09:31,400 --> 00:09:33,600
were also soul-extracted and refined into formation spirits !

84
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:41,440
Rank 1 Celestial Lords of the Thunder Celestial Realm !

85
00:09:41,760 --> 00:09:43,790
Third soul, second soul,

86
00:09:44,560 --> 00:09:45,230
get into position !

87
00:09:50,680 --> 00:09:52,710
One last one remains.

88
00:10:27,160 --> 00:10:28,190
Just its killing intent

89
00:10:29,160 --> 00:10:30,590
is enough to shake the world !

90
00:10:46,880 --> 00:10:50,000
The rank 6 Slaughter Celestial Lord of the Rain Celestial Realm

91
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:51,990
has also fallen into your hands.

92
00:10:55,520 --> 00:10:57,150
First soul,

93
00:10:57,600 --> 00:10:58,790
get into position.

94
00:11:09,400 --> 00:11:10,800
Celestial Formation,

95
00:11:11,760 --> 00:11:12,790
activate !

96
00:11:15,920 --> 00:11:18,000
This formation now has world-destroying power...

97
00:11:18,600 --> 00:11:20,010
But why did Master Flamespark

98
00:11:20,040 --> 00:11:22,390
go through the trouble of luring Qing Shui here ?

99
00:11:24,160 --> 00:11:24,950
Nice formation.

100
00:11:26,320 --> 00:11:28,200
Although this Celestial Formation is powerful,

101
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:30,190
it still lacks sharpness.

102
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:34,390
I understand now why you're after me.

103
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:37,470
That's correct.

104
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:39,350
I invited you here

105
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:41,350
precisely so you can help me

106
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:44,000
to complete the Celestial Formation with your Ji Realm !

107
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:45,590
May I ask Celestial Lord Qing Shui

108
00:11:45,760 --> 00:11:47,110
what you think of this ?

109
00:11:47,280 --> 00:11:48,630
I told you before

110
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:50,790
that I'm not Qing Shui !

111
00:11:53,520 --> 00:11:55,230
It seems your memory

112
00:11:55,560 --> 00:11:58,470
has been sleeping within the seal for too long...

113
00:11:59,160 --> 00:12:00,110
But today,

114
00:12:00,560 --> 00:12:02,360
I shall use this Celestial Descent Platform

115
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:03,710
to help you remember !

116
00:12:04,680 --> 00:12:07,520
This old man has been to the Celestial Realm hundreds of times

117
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:09,080
and read countless ancient jades

118
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:10,470
until I found this one !

119
00:12:12,040 --> 00:12:13,670
What this jade slip records

120
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:17,280
is precisely the life of Celestial Emperor Bai Fan's disciple,

121
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:20,310
Celestial Lord Qing Shui.

122
00:12:23,520 --> 00:12:25,350
Your name is Qing Shui.

123
00:12:26,280 --> 00:12:29,910
You were a crown prince in the ancient cultivation world, in the Clear Water State.

124
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:33,120
When you ascended to the Celestial Realm back then,

125
00:12:33,360 --> 00:12:34,870
you came to this very place,

126
00:12:35,720 --> 00:12:37,110
the Celestial Descent Platform.

127
00:12:39,160 --> 00:12:40,670
And it was also here

128
00:12:41,240 --> 00:12:42,950
that you met Celestial Emperor Bai Fan

129
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:45,120
and were taken as his disciple.

130
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:47,830
During the next tens of thousands of years,

131
00:12:48,440 --> 00:12:50,710
you followed Bai Fan in campaigns across the lands

132
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:52,190
to expand his territory.

133
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:56,070
You brought honor to your family.

134
00:12:56,160 --> 00:12:58,120
How glorious it was...

135
00:13:00,240 --> 00:13:01,630
But overnight,

136
00:13:01,680 --> 00:13:03,230
Dear ! What's wrong with you ?

137
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:04,150
You lost your mind

138
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:06,320
and fell to a demonic possession.

139
00:13:06,920 --> 00:13:08,430
Everyone around you

140
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:10,670
died by your hand.

141
00:13:18,040 --> 00:13:20,110
You possessed the Ji Realm,

142
00:13:20,400 --> 00:13:22,030
so naturally, no one could stand against you.

143
00:13:22,280 --> 00:13:24,000
You slaughtered countless people.

144
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:25,270
That's how

145
00:13:25,800 --> 00:13:28,230
you brought about the most tragic calamity

146
00:13:28,560 --> 00:13:30,310
since the creation of the Thunder Celestial Realm.

147
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:34,510
Then your master,

148
00:13:34,920 --> 00:13:37,310
Celestial Emperor Bai Fan, personally arrived,

149
00:13:41,840 --> 00:13:44,120
and helpd you regain your senses.

150
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:46,270
But the damage had already been done.

151
00:13:55,440 --> 00:13:56,190
Yan'er !

152
00:14:02,520 --> 00:14:03,070
No...

153
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:04,390
No...

154
00:14:07,520 --> 00:14:08,110
Impossible...

155
00:14:14,880 --> 00:14:15,510
Yan'er,

156
00:14:16,240 --> 00:14:17,030
wake up.

157
00:14:17,840 --> 00:14:18,510
It's me,

158
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:20,070
I'm back.

159
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:34,550
Yan'er !

160
00:14:36,160 --> 00:14:37,510
Nooo !!!

161
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:57,550
That day,

162
00:14:58,040 --> 00:15:01,030
you split your own body apart in your despair,

163
00:15:01,640 --> 00:15:03,230
and sealed it with artifacts

164
00:15:03,440 --> 00:15:05,430
to condemn yourself to never be reborn.

165
00:15:06,560 --> 00:15:07,830
Bai Fan couldn't bear it,

166
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:11,230
so he placed a healing formation outside the seals

167
00:15:12,400 --> 00:15:16,270
in hope that you would awaken one day.

168
00:15:22,040 --> 00:15:24,190
If you help me to complete this formation,

169
00:15:24,720 --> 00:15:27,590
I will find the cause of your demonic possession.

170
00:15:28,640 --> 00:15:29,510
After that,

171
00:15:30,240 --> 00:15:32,470
you'll be able to avenge your loved ones !

172
00:15:34,320 --> 00:15:35,560
He gathered formation spirits,

173
00:15:35,640 --> 00:15:36,840
raised Thunder Beasts,

174
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:38,280
and refined the Celestial Realm...

175
00:15:39,240 --> 00:15:40,790
To make Qing Shui help him,

176
00:15:41,400 --> 00:15:42,910
he investigated for tens of thousands of years.

177
00:15:45,240 --> 00:15:46,830
This man's behavior seems crazy

178
00:15:47,560 --> 00:15:48,750
but in reality, every move he makes

179
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:50,880
is planned meticulously.

180
00:15:51,080 --> 00:15:51,830
Enough !

181
00:15:59,480 --> 00:16:00,030
Qing Shui,

182
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:02,280
I've helped you recover your memories

183
00:16:02,280 --> 00:16:03,200
out of good will !

184
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:04,270
What do you mean by this ?

185
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:10,030
Could he...

186
00:16:10,240 --> 00:16:12,350
have been overtaken by his demonic thoughts once again ?

187
00:16:13,680 --> 00:16:15,080
That shouldn't be possible.

188
00:16:15,720 --> 00:16:17,270
I had finally forgotten...

189
00:16:18,200 --> 00:16:19,310
Why did you...

190
00:16:20,040 --> 00:16:22,310
have to remind me ?

191
00:16:36,760 --> 00:16:38,150
Call the Wind !

192
00:16:53,120 --> 00:16:55,480
Celestial Formation, assemble origin !

193
00:17:05,280 --> 00:17:06,070
This is...

194
00:17:06,840 --> 00:17:08,470
the true power of Call the Wind !

195
00:17:13,360 --> 00:17:14,390
Celestial Lord Qing Shui,

196
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:15,590
do you know

197
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:17,470
that not long after you were sealed,

198
00:17:17,720 --> 00:17:19,910
your master Bai Fan died under mysterious circumstances

199
00:17:20,320 --> 00:17:22,350
and the Thunder Celestial Realm collapsed soon after ?

200
00:17:22,760 --> 00:17:23,670
Don't you want to...

201
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:24,510
Shut up !

202
00:17:26,560 --> 00:17:27,590
Summon the Rain !

203
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:34,870
Ice Seal !

204
00:17:40,080 --> 00:17:40,990
After Call the Wind

205
00:17:41,480 --> 00:17:42,390
comes Summon the Rain.

206
00:17:43,240 --> 00:17:44,840
The Celestial Emperor's spells

207
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:46,720
are truly extraordinary.

208
00:17:47,040 --> 00:17:47,950
Qing Shui,

209
00:17:48,560 --> 00:17:51,110
Your best choice is to join forces with me.

210
00:17:51,960 --> 00:17:53,590
You and I are not enemies.

211
00:17:54,200 --> 00:17:57,070
Don't refuse my kind offer only to end up with a worse one !

212
00:18:00,240 --> 00:18:01,710
You need to restore your cultivation

213
00:18:01,760 --> 00:18:03,760
and require a massive amount of origin energy.

214
00:18:03,840 --> 00:18:05,910
Come with me to the Alliance Star System

215
00:18:06,240 --> 00:18:08,150
and devour strong cultivators there.

216
00:18:08,800 --> 00:18:10,150
With my help,

217
00:18:10,560 --> 00:18:12,750
your cultivation will soon return to its peak !

218
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:15,990
That reason

219
00:18:16,640 --> 00:18:17,720
isn't enough !

220
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:29,550
As expected...

221
00:18:30,280 --> 00:18:31,680
Just some residual energy

222
00:18:31,800 --> 00:18:34,190
is enough to take my life.

223
00:18:34,400 --> 00:18:36,960
I found that when you fell into demonic possession back then,

224
00:18:37,040 --> 00:18:39,270
someone in the Rain Celestial Realm also suffered the same fate.

225
00:18:41,280 --> 00:18:42,510
If you help me,

226
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:45,990
I will provide you with the clues and the survivors !

227
00:18:47,160 --> 00:18:48,040
Not enough !

228
00:18:51,040 --> 00:18:53,470
The Cultivation Alliance has a scroll within its archives

229
00:18:53,800 --> 00:18:56,350
that surfaced shortly after the Celestial Realm collapsed.

230
00:18:57,000 --> 00:19:00,470
This item is deeply connected to the destruction of the Celestial Realm !

231
00:19:01,360 --> 00:19:02,830
Your demonic possession,

232
00:19:03,120 --> 00:19:04,310
Bai Fan's death,

233
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:06,590
and the fall of the Celestial Realm

234
00:19:07,280 --> 00:19:10,150
have all been orchestrated by the same thing !

235
00:19:10,720 --> 00:19:12,830
Don't you want to uncover the truth

236
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:14,750
and avenge your loved one ?

237
00:19:53,440 --> 00:19:54,670
If you lied to me,

238
00:19:55,560 --> 00:19:56,990
I will detonate the Ji Realm

239
00:19:58,080 --> 00:19:59,510
and reduce this formation

240
00:19:59,800 --> 00:20:01,590
to dust.

241
00:20:06,840 --> 00:20:08,230
Celestial Lord can rest assured,

242
00:20:08,880 --> 00:20:09,750
this old man

243
00:20:10,080 --> 00:20:11,440
is not lying !

244
00:20:28,200 --> 00:20:29,870
Celestial Lord, come with me

245
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:31,710
to meet my friends in the Allheaven Star System.

246
00:20:32,120 --> 00:20:32,920
And then,

247
00:20:32,960 --> 00:20:34,440
we will open a passage

248
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:35,910
straight to the Alliance Star System

249
00:20:36,400 --> 00:20:38,190
and turn it upside down !

250
00:20:41,040 --> 00:20:42,120
Senior, please wait !

251
00:20:45,520 --> 00:20:47,110
Congratulations on completing the formation.

252
00:20:48,200 --> 00:20:49,380
Could you give Junior

253
00:20:49,480 --> 00:20:50,710
his Thunder Beast back ?

254
00:20:52,320 --> 00:20:54,350
I still need your Thunder Beast for a few more days.

255
00:20:55,040 --> 00:20:57,350
After I open the passage to the Alliance,

256
00:20:57,520 --> 00:20:58,550
I will return it to you.

257
00:21:00,440 --> 00:21:01,550
Little guy,

258
00:21:01,920 --> 00:21:03,670
you are fated with me.

259
00:21:04,560 --> 00:21:06,990
If you can leave the Thunder Celestial Realm safely,

260
00:21:08,000 --> 00:21:10,030
take this token to the Thunder Celestial Temple

261
00:21:10,720 --> 00:21:13,190
and I will grant you another fortuitous opportunity.

262
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:17,790
Since you have learned Call the Wind,

263
00:21:18,240 --> 00:21:20,150
you still count as my master's disciple.

264
00:21:20,800 --> 00:21:21,350
Remember,

265
00:21:22,200 --> 00:21:24,870
this spell is one of the 6 great spells he created.

266
00:21:25,640 --> 00:21:28,150
Don't let it gather dust in your hands.

267
00:21:40,200 --> 00:21:41,810
The Celestial Realm Gate was destroyed.

268
00:21:42,040 --> 00:21:42,870
There is only one way

269
00:21:43,680 --> 00:21:44,470
to leave this place.

270
00:21:45,880 --> 00:21:47,160
To enter and exit the Thunder Celestial Realm

271
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:48,360
apart from the Celestial Gate,

272
00:21:48,400 --> 00:21:51,000
there are ancient teleportation formations controlled by the Thunder Celestial Temple.

273
00:21:51,240 --> 00:21:52,150
I have

274
00:21:52,280 --> 00:21:53,930
placed their location within my Dao Soul

275
00:21:54,040 --> 00:21:55,720
so Master can use them if needed.

276
00:22:19,710 --> 00:24:53,920
The State of Clear Water is an important part of in the lore of the Er Gen universe. For instance, it's heavily referenced in I Shall Seal the Heavens. They added in a lot of details in the scenes of this episode which is a very nice touch !

Clear Water is the literal translation of Qing Shui. For simplicity's sake, we will refer to the character as Qing Shui and his country as Clear Water.

277
00:22:40,960 --> 00:22:46,440
Ask

278
00:22:42,560 --> 00:22:44,360
Qi Condensation

279
00:22:43,480 --> 00:22:46,520
the perilous path filled with countless blades.

280
